# IndexNow: notify search engines of changed public URLs after revalidation.
# Unset keeps the feature off. Set an 8-128 [a-zA-Z0-9-] value to enable;
# /<key>.txt is then served at the site root for ownership verification.
# INDEXNOW_KEY=

# Web Push daily perek reminder (#1096). Any unset value keeps the feature off.
# Generate keys with `bunx web-push generate-vapid-keys`.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:admin@example.com
# PUSH_SEND_SECRET=
